#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:3
#: 60fc98a3fd0842e997c8721e2df4b413
msgid "成分梯度（Composition Gradient）"
msgstr "Composition Gradient"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:5
#: 6704e7c24409406ba114ddce7238d840
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `CompositionGradientCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:7
#: c0831d46ce05412a9dcb02abd3a73eb8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:9
#: a33b4cf0205d4213838f68c35828b1d2
msgid ""
"`Composition Gradient` 沿 x/y/z "
"方向把结构分成若干坐标层，并在每层按起点成分到终点成分的线性插值替换元素。它用于扩散偶、梯度合金和界面过渡层，不等价于全局随机合金。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Gradient` divides a structure into coordinate bins along x, y, "
"or z and replaces elements in each bin according to a linear interpolation "
"between endpoint compositions. It models diffusion couples, graded alloys, "
"and interfacial transition layers, not a globally random alloy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:11
#: 920d924e7fd648f294684f27ebf6cd7e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:13
#: eed6ef90babc459aa0a136ec73884c62
msgid "场景：模型缺少扩散偶过渡层"
msgstr "Scenario: A diffusion-couple transition layer is missing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:15
#: 665d33f01ea947de8c5c83e58c8a3843
msgid "Ni-Co 训练集包含纯 Ni、纯 Co 和均匀随机合金，但没有从 Ni-rich 到 Co-rich 的空间过渡结构。模型在界面扩散偶上出现系统误差。"
msgstr ""
"A Ni-Co training set contains pure Ni, pure Co, and homogeneous random "
"alloys but no spatial transition from Ni-rich to Co-rich material. The model"
" consequently shows systematic error at a diffusion-couple interface."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:17
#: cdd77bd99a344aef9063851c31c3529f
msgid ""
"**输入：** 沿 x 方向足够长的 Ni 或 Ni-Co 超胞。 **目标：** 生成 x 方向从 `Ni:1,Co:0` 到 `Ni:0,Co:1`"
" 的配比梯度。 **参数设置：** `elements=Ni,Co`，`axis=x`，`bins=8`，`samples=3`，开启 "
"`use_seed`。 **输出：** 每个输入结构生成 3 个具有相同层配比、不同层内随机排布的梯度结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 按 x "
"分层统计元素比例，应从 Ni-rich 单调过渡到 Co-rich；重训后扩散偶界面测试误差应下降。"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A Ni or Ni-Co supercell long enough along x. **Objective:** "
"Create an x-directed gradient from `Ni:1,Co:0` to `Ni:0,Co:1`. "
"**Parameters:** `elements=Ni,Co`, `axis=x`, `bins=8`, `samples=3`, with "
"`use_seed` enabled. **Output:** Three structures per input with identical "
"layer compositions and different within-layer arrangements. "
"**Verification:** Element fractions binned along x should change "
"monotonically from Ni-rich to Co-rich, and the retrained model should reduce"
" error on diffusion-couple interface tests."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:23
#: 29b551b9349b4ecf85e84af0f8a549d2
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:25
#: 5391c9236bbe4fd4978482e98f362b28
msgid "Elements（elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:27
#: 97ee2f8838c14714a4da9eb93989e23a
msgid "`str`，默认 `Ni,Co`。梯度端点中参与插值的元素集合。二元扩散偶写两个元素即可，三元过渡层把你关心的所有成分变化元素都列进去。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni,Co`. Elements whose endpoint fractions are interpolated. "
"Two elements are sufficient for a binary diffusion couple; list every "
"composition-varying element for a ternary transition layer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:29
#: 5be1510c7b574b9c997d64bbf0971ca7
msgid "Start Composition（start_composition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:31
#: 7ad5a8cdde3d499b8481e2d7f4b634a2
msgid "`str`，默认 `Ni:1,Co:0`。梯度起点的目标元素比例，对应 axis 低坐标端。比例不要求归一化，各元素相对比值决定第一层的目标配比。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni:1,Co:0`. Target ratios at the low-coordinate end of the "
"selected axis. Values need not be normalized; their relative magnitudes set "
"the first bin's composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:33
#: 6c2ed6193a664c0d9b302604cb2adb54
msgid "End Composition（end_composition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:35
#: e66d73245e6d40ea9cebedabf74a889e
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Ni:0,Co:1`。梯度终点的目标元素比例，对应 axis 高坐标端。扩散偶通常把一个元素从 1 过渡到 0、另一个从 0 过渡到"
" 1。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni:0,Co:1`. Target ratios at the high-coordinate end. A "
"binary diffusion couple commonly changes one element from 1 to 0 and the "
"other from 0 to 1."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:37
#: 3fb0dca0910941428ba303c8d27feca2
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:39
#: 017e9afd0e1b4bd2a184b2b9a90d797b
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `x`，可选 `x`/`y`/`z`。选真实扩散或界面法向方向。cell "
"在这个方向上必须有足够层数，否则每层原子太少，整数取整会让目标比例失真。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `x`; one of `x`, `y`, or `z`. Choose the physical diffusion "
"direction or interface normal. The cell must contain enough atomic layers "
"along this axis, otherwise integer counts distort target fractions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:41
#: 3fc3749a70af4b8095a5dae17f155668
msgid "Bins（bins）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:43
#: 93de88e58be64b12bc4da799f0c7d1f3
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 8。沿梯度轴划分的组成层数。bins 越多梯度越细，但每层原子越少、取整误差越大。小超胞用 4-8 层，大超胞或界面模型可用 8-20"
" 层。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `8`. Number of composition bins along the gradient axis. More"
" bins make a finer gradient but leave fewer atoms per bin and larger "
"rounding error. Use about 4-8 bins for a small supercell and 8-20 for a "
"large interface model."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:45
#: a3f3b8519cea4f72b330d51e2622dd47
msgid "Target Elements（target_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:47
#: 79f3cb3e5ec24776a9b1e02e84fc57fc
msgid "`str`，默认空。留空时所有匹配元素都可被重排；只想替换某个子晶格或特定层时，显式列出目标元素，避免把基底或不参与扩散的元素也改掉。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Empty means every matching element may be "
"rearranged. List target elements explicitly to limit replacement to a "
"sublattice or selected species and protect the substrate or nondiffusing "
"elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:49
#: 471d0e1e424242fa98a9d8d12ddca78c
msgid "Samples（samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:51
#: f1af123d08c5440bb2f963dd2b877321
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成几个样本。同一层目标比例下，samples 只改变层内随机排布。1-3 个适合扩散偶，5 "
"个以上才适合做层内无序统计。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Samples generated per input. At fixed bin fractions, "
"additional samples change only the random within-bin arrangement. One to "
"three are typical for a diffusion couple; use five or more only to study "
"within-layer disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:53
#: 978739214b07470c9310206c779822c0
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:55
#: 9b1b411c67874e0880c9840fec4cefb0
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。需要可复现训练集或对比实验时打开；最终大规模随机探索可以关掉，但结果不能逐帧复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for a reproducible training set or "
"controlled comparison. It may be disabled for large exploratory sampling, "
"but individual frames will not be reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:57
#: 51fa0dacb15743c0939cb530f5c4f6f5
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:59
#: eb642b5e3e8849f780d84145535eb60e
msgid "`int`，默认 0。同一输入、同一参数、同一 seed 生成同一批候选。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Identical input, parameters, and seed produce the same "
"candidates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:61
#: ef1aec300a7e4f35a240ec97ba7152d5
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:63
#: 1ef2f383f73447b9830a517100ee590a
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:65
#: 76738c19f31749e787ca021b6a2b4435
msgid "二元扩散偶"
msgstr "Binary diffusion couple"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:67
#: f2dde31e5b844db8a54aa4047132dc72
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionGradientCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Ni,Co\",\n"
"    \"start_composition\": \"Ni:1,Co:0\",\n"
"    \"end_composition\": \"Ni:0,Co:1\",\n"
"    \"axis\": \"x\",\n"
"    \"bins\": 8,\n"
"    \"target_elements\": \"\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 3,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:84
#: 5d6e1162d57b4da196b778fa0eed3a9c
msgid "用于 Ni-rich 到 Co-rich 的一维过渡层。"
msgstr "A one-dimensional transition from Ni-rich to Co-rich material."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:86
#: ba74e0c998764fa9b4f6ffe4c236e615
msgid "三元梯度层"
msgstr "Ternary graded layer"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:88
#: bd1e81e9b4184474a2b51826dd41abce
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionGradientCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"    \"start_composition\": \"Co:0.8,Cr:0.1,Ni:0.1\",\n"
"    \"end_composition\": \"Co:0.1,Cr:0.4,Ni:0.5\",\n"
"    \"axis\": \"z\",\n"
"    \"bins\": 10,\n"
"    \"target_elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 9\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:105
#: fb2a32b4616f4573ae6e6c04d8c500e1
msgid "用于多元合金的层状成分过渡。"
msgstr "A layered composition transition in a multicomponent alloy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:107
#: 1012007a1fdb460d8d4cfaf75fb9c8ec
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:109
#: d1257f15159e4d0880052a2b1b186991
msgid "`Super Cell → Composition Gradient → Geometry Filter`：先给梯度方向足够层数，再做配比梯度和几何检查。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell -> Composition Gradient -> Geometry Filter`: create enough "
"layers along the gradient, assign compositions, then check geometry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:110
#: 04f441550f9f4ec4b8351e63720eb9ee
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Composition Gradient → Atomic "
"Perturb`：先生成晶体模板，再加空间成分梯度和局部位移。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder -> Super Cell -> Composition Gradient -> Atomic "
"Perturb`: build a crystal template, then add a spatial composition gradient "
"and local displacements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:111
#: 0fb64b1fd5a743449c09e9671d353a3b
msgid "`Composition Gradient → FPS Filter`：生成多组梯度结构后选代表帧。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Gradient -> FPS Filter`: select representative frames from "
"several graded structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:113
#: dea3cbecd92b4684bae2a9c80f0a9b0e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:115
#: 9e706190143f418da738a6e885358882
msgid "**层内成分不等于目标小数。** 原子数是整数，每层按最接近的整数计数分配。增大超胞或减少 `bins` 可以提高每层成分分辨率。"
msgstr ""
"**A bin fraction does not exactly equal the requested decimal.** Atom counts"
" are integers and use the nearest feasible allocation. Increase the "
"supercell or reduce `bins` to improve composition resolution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:117
#: e5ed2383c6cc4e318572a7e65e17ebea
msgid "**运行报错或没有输出。** `elements` 少于 2 个、起止成分解析失败，或 `target_elements` 没有匹配到原子。"
msgstr ""
"**The operation fails or returns no output.** Check that `elements` contains"
" at least two species, both endpoint compositions parse correctly, and "
"`target_elements` matches atoms in the input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:119
#: 4f82ce396cac49eca0fe553eba32df59
msgid ""
"**周期结构的起点在哪里。** 周期方向使用 wrapped fractional coordinate 排序；非周期方向使用 Cartesian "
"coordinate 排序。"
msgstr ""
"**Where does a periodic gradient start?** Periodic axes are ordered by "
"wrapped fractional coordinate; nonperiodic axes use Cartesian coordinate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:121
#: 57f1209db38b474d87641ec994aec9e4
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:123
#: da6c34143be145c18514c1b8527037f3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`CompGrad(ax={x|y|z},b={bins},s={seed})`。`s` 只在 `use_seed=True` 时出现。"
msgstr ""
"`CompGrad(ax={x|y|z},b={bins},s={seed})`; `s` appears only when "
"`use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:125
#: c63dea4afd4b4124be7277d70d45e6d2
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:127
#: 62003f04b58f46aeb1a6688d1e248062
msgid "开启 `use_seed` 后，层内元素排布由 `seed`、输入结构标识和 sample 序号共同决定。"
msgstr ""
"With `use_seed` enabled, the within-bin arrangement is determined by `seed`,"
" the input-structure identity, and the sample index."
